"The Geldor Spire holds the first-bound augera, the oldest, strongest and most changed of them all."
"The Geldor augera is tired and melancholic; most of it roams free in the depths of arcana."
"Whoever enters the Geldor Spire is carried straight to the augera's chamber, unable to mark the way."
"The chamber floor is black marble with golden glyphs from no known set, holding the crystal aloft."
"The Geldor augera mended Caden Dundale's shattered flare there last winter."
"The Chosen One spent a night in the Geldor Spire and first pierced the veil into oblivion there."
"Safehouse 3 is the Ka'atryn mansion; agents weave sequences into the arcanic sea around its grounds."
"The Geldor augera gave Devon Ka'atryn glyphs to freeze agents in stasis and hide his friends."
"The blast in Geldor came when Caden Dundale broke a Sedhahn military sequence by force of will."
"Near a rest stop on a road out of Geldor, the Geldor and Hanafast Spires' coverage overlaps."
"A wellspring-ocean-core lurks near the forest by that rest stop and warps space and time there."
